    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me write a memo for a board of directors? we're looking at moving more of our investment into ESG-focused funds and i need to make a strong case for why this is the right move for the company's long-term future. can u outline the main benefits and why it's basically necessary for us to do this now?",
