    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but some of the board members are gonna be really skeptical. they're worried that focusing on \"social\" or \"environmental\" stuff is just a distraction from our core duty to make money for shareholders. how should i handle their argument that ESG is just virtue signaling and hurts our bottom line?",
