      "content": "Address their concern by reframing ESG not as an add-on, but as enhanced due diligence on future revenue drivers. Argue that strong ESG practices signal better operational governance, which directly translates to sound financial management and reduced hidden liabilities. You can assert that today's market leaders are those who successfully integrate sustainability into value creation, proving that ethics and profitability are increasingly intertwined. This shifts the narrative from expense to strategic financial insulation and growth funding.",
      "source": "target",
