      "content": "The truth is that while financial consensus is still developing, numerous large-scale studies are strongly indicating a correlation between strong ESG integration and lower risk and more resilient long-term returns. Instead of claiming it is an absolute guarantee, present it as a shift towards better information—ESG forces a deeper dive into a company's operational quality beyond just quarterly earnings. Conclude that while risks exist, deliberately ignoring these material risks is a clearer threat to the bottom line than prudently incorporating this evolving data.",
